OL,3,GNEWSA'Radiation fears' on site of new
OL,4,Ahousing development
OL,5,
OL,6,FA campaigner has called for further
OL,7,Finvestigations after a new survey found
OL,8,Fsome signs of potential radiation
OL,9,Fcontamination at a proposed major
OL,10,Fdevelopment.
OL,12,FNottinghamshire County Council has put
OL,13,Fin an application to build 550 new
OL,14,Fhomes, a school, and traveller pitches
OL,15,Fon land near Tollerton.
OL,17,FAs part of the application, the ground
OL,18,Fwas checked for radiation, and two
OL,19,Fareas of "elevated readings" were
OL,20,Ffound.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
