OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1795001169
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSA'Radiation fears' on site of new
OL,4,Ahousing development
OL,5,
OL,6,FSurveyors said the risk was low,
OL,7,Fparticularly given the area it was
OL,8,Ffound in was set to be green space, but
OL,9,FSarah Deacon, chairwoman of the Save
OL,10,FNottingham Airfield Group, said she was
OL,11,Fworried it had not been "definitively"
OL,12,Fdeclared safe.
